---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="页面未找到" description="请求的页面不存在。" noindex>
  <section class="not-found page-shell">
    <p class="eyebrow">404 / Not found</p>
    <h1>这条路径没有内容。</h1>
    <p>链接可能已经失效，也可能只是多打了一个字符。</p>
    <div>
      <a href="/">返回首页</a>
      <a href="/posts/">浏览文章</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .not-found {
    display: grid;
    min-height: 65svh;
    padding-block: 5rem;
    align-content: center;
  }

  h1 {
    max-width: 12ch;
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 6rem);
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.06em;
  }

  .not-found > p:not(.eyebrow) {
    color: var(--color-muted);
  }

  .not-found div {
    display: flex;
    margin-top: 1rem;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .not-found a {
    color: var(--color-accent);
    font-weight: 750;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
</style>
